<title>NORWAY: Hydro accepts William bid for Terra.</title>
<headline>Hydro accepts William bid for Terra.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Norsk Hydro ASA said on Monday it had accepted a bid by Canadian miner William Resources Inc for its shares in Swedish gold miner Terra Mining AB.</p>
<p>William earlier said it had made a 162.50 crowns per share bid for Terra.</p>
</text>
